          "short": "$23\\times47$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}35^2-12^2&=(35-12)(35+12)\\\\35^2-12^2&=23\\times47\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
